analysis.R

Main entry point that runs the whole pipeline and calls the scripts below.



gene_score_analysis.R

Computes the gene-score correlations, their jackknife covariance, and the two main SEMs.



gene_set_enrichment_sem.R

Fits the same SEMs to the gene set enrichment correlations.



equal_loading_wald_test.R

Tests whether the paired trait loadings can be held equal.



free_split_half_loadings.R

Refits the models with every trait loading estimated separately. This script generates the main results ultimately included in the paper.



split_half_ratio_models.R

Refits the models allowing the two split-half loadings per trait to differ by a ratio.



split_half_design_simulation.R

Simulates the split-half design to check that the models recover the right answer.


render_paired_figure.R

Draws the same-trait versus cross-trait gene set correlation figure.


build_gene_score_workbook.mjs

Writes the gene-score results into a formatted Excel workbook.


build_paper_results_workbook.mjs

Writes the paper's results tables into a formatted Excel workbook.
